\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: Japan  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Data Suggest USD At Y117.50 Key \b0\par\par\uc2 370 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 November 2001\par 07:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2001, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  U.S. stock futures were led lower as Qualcomm's earnings - released during U.S. after-hours trade - came in at 23 cents per share, 2 cents below analysts' consensus estimate. The issue's shares plunged 8.3% after hours. \par \par \uc2  Tokyo players expressed some skepticism towards the impact of the Qualcomm news on the dollar, however. "There was no impact on the dollar when stocks fell last week and I think this shows the connection between stocks and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  is lessening," said a German bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  The dollar fell against the yen, led lower by its losses against the euro. \par \par \uc2  The dollar's decline was also accelerated by stop-loss orders lined up under the Y121.00 mark that were triggered when the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell below that level, players said. \par \par \uc2  Fujita said however, that the dollar should find support at Y120.50, and others said most market players will be reluctant to sell the U.S. unit below Y120 out of fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Japanese authorities. \par \par \uc2  Underlining these concerns, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday said its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  totaled Y3.211 trillion in the July-September period, when it sold the yen for the dollar and the euro to stem the yen's rise in the wake of the Sept. 11 terrorist attacks in the U.S. \par \par \uc2  Ken Landon, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Deutsche Bank in Tokyo, said the weighted average of MOF's dollar purchases (carried out by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was around Y117.50, making this area a crucial level for the market to watch. \par \par \uc2  Sterling was at $1.4640, up from $1.4575 in New York and higher than $1.4589 in Tokyo Tuesday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    -By Audrey McAvoy, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929;\par audrey.mcavoy@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The chart of late Tokyo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates which accompanied Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has\par been replaced with an enhanced \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fixture which is updated\par hourly.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Subscribers can find this table:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011107dxb7000co\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
