\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dollar hurt by grim retail sales, anthrax scare.  \b0\par\par\uc2      By Daniel Sternoff  \par \uc2 675 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Oktober 2001\par 22:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited \par \par \uc2      NEW YORK, Oct 12 (Reuters) - The dollar sank against the  \par \par \uc2  euro and Swiss franc on Friday after a report showed U.S.  \par \par \uc2  retail sales plunged in the wake of last month's suicide  \par \par \uc2  airplane attacks and as a reported anthrax case in New York  \par \par \uc2  stokes fears of possible biological attacks.  \par \par \uc2  The day's news was a double blow to the dollar, coming just  \par \par \uc2  a day after the greenback managed to recover all the ground it  \par \par \uc2  lost after the Sept. 11 attacks, when hijackers slammed  \par \par \uc2  airplanes into New York's World Trade Center and the Pentagon.  \par \par \uc2  The morning began with news of a 2.4 percent slide in U.S.  \par \par \uc2  retail sales in September - the steepest falloff in nearly  \par \par \uc2  nine years. The dollar tumbled as investors fretted falling  \par \par \uc2  consumer spending will drive the economy into a recession.  \par \par \uc2  An unexpected rise in a gauge of U.S. consumer confidence  \par \par \uc2  briefly tempered the dollar's losses, but the greenback lurched  \par \par \uc2  even lower still after NBC said a news employee tested positive  \par \par \uc2  for cutaneous anthrax, the fourth confirmed exposure to the  \par \par \uc2  deadly bacteria at a media company since Sept. 11.  \par \par \uc2  The NBC anthrax case comes after three workers at a tabloid  \par \par \uc2  newspaper in Florida were diagnosed with respiratory anthrax, a  \par \par \uc2  different form of the disease. The government said there was no  \par \par \uc2  evidence to link the New York and Florida cases.  \par \par \uc2  Stocks fell sharply and U.S. Treasuries rallied after the  \par \par \uc2  anthrax report. The dollar fell more than 1 percent against the  \par \par \uc2  safe-haven Swiss franc and lost ground to the euro, sterling  \par \par \uc2  and yen.  \par \par \uc2      "The markets are very, very nervous," said John McCarthy,  \par \par \uc2  director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at ING Barings Capital Markets.  \par \par \uc2      "It is possible there will be a cumulative effect of these  \par \par \uc2  events here in the United States that will have a profound  \par \par \uc2  effect on the consumer, business investment, equity markets and  \par \par \uc2  the economy that are worse here than in any other place in the  \par \par \uc2  world, which will have an effect on the dollar," he said.  \par \par \uc2  The euro sailed as high as 91.25 cents, snapping a  \par \par \uc2  three-day losing streak that took it to one-month lows against  \par \par \uc2  the dollar below 90 cents on Thursday, before settling just  \par \par \uc2  below 91 cents in late Friday trade.  \par \par \uc2      The dollar fell as low as 120.74 yen before steadying near  \par \par \uc2  121.25 yen.  \par \par \uc2      Against the Swiss franc -- the biggest beneficiary in the  \par \par \uc2  uncertainty following the Sept. 11 attacks -- the dollar fell  \par \par \uc2  as far as 1.6250 francs before steadying near 1.6280 francs.  \par \par \uc2      "We tell some of our clients to keep your mouse clicked to  \par \par \uc2  dollar/Swiss and watch CNN. That's how you can combat the war  \par \par \uc2  with your money," said Ashraf Laidi, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at  \par \par \uc2  MG Financial Group.  \par \par \uc2  "I heard traders joke: 'I hedged the Swiss franc against  \par \par \uc2  anthrax.' It's horrible, but that is really what is happening  \par \par \uc2  here," he said.  \par \par \uc2  UNCERTAINTY KEEPS \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  WITHIN RANGES  \par \par \uc2  Despite the dollar's steep losses, \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were confined  \par \par \uc2  to recent ranges, with dealers uncertain how to trade amid  \par \par \uc2  fears of attacks, concerns over the global economy, and the  \par \par \uc2  U.S.-led assault in Afghanistan.  \par \par \uc2  "You might see people pulling back altogether and not doing  \par \par \uc2  anything - because it's just too hard. It's too hard to make  \par \par \uc2  sense of what is going on," said ING's McCarthy.  \par \par \uc2  While the dollar was dented by security and economic fears,  \par \par \uc2  analysts said euro gains could be limited after confidence in  \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was damaged on Thursday, when the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central  \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  disappointed the market by leaving interest rates steady.  \par \par \uc2      Dealers may also be cautious about selling the dollar too  \par \par \uc2  aggressively against the yen.  \par \par \uc2      Overnight, Japanese Finance Minister Masajuro Shiokawa said  \par \par \uc2  it might be better if the yen were slightly weaker than current  \par \par \uc2  levels around 120-121 per dollar, and said \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  stood ready to  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  should the yen rise against the dollar  \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the yen seven times in September  \par \par \uc2  to curb the yen's export-damaging strength.  \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011012dxac0124e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
