\par\par \b \uc2  Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -2: On Guard For More  \highlight22\uc2 Japan FX Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 378 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 2001\par 08:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2001, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  While Japanese authorities have been absent from \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets this month after aggressively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the yen in September, market players still expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the Bank of Japan to step in if the dollar falls too far too fast. \par \par \uc2  Zembei Mizoguchi, head of the MOF's International Bureau, gave weight to that view Wednesday morning; "Our wish to curb excessive yen strength is unchanged," he told reporters. \par \par \uc2  He added that the Group of Seven nations have agreed to cooperate in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as necessary, when pressed about the possibility of joint action. \par \par \uc2  At their meeting in Washington D.C. last Saturday, the G7 finance ministers and central bankers said in a statement, "we will continue to monitor exchange markets closely and cooperate as appropriate." \par \par \uc2  Regardless, Tokyo is expected to act alone if it does continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  "While the U.S. may acknowledge the need to keep the dollar from crumbling, it's unlikely it would actively participate in pushing it sharply higher," said a foreign bank trader. \par \par \uc2  The greenback also remained firm against the euro and other European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , such as sterling and the Swiss franc after gaining overnight on short-covering. \par \par \uc2  Positions were adjusted as "the dollar was sold for safe haven \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but it was overdone," according to a trader at a Japanese trust bank. \par \par \uc2  Still, as underlying concerns continues to be about the greenback, the euro is expected to resume its uptrend after the current correction runs its course, traders said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sterling was at $1.4591, up slightly from $1.4581 in New York but\par sharply lower than $1.4723 in Tokyo Tuesday. Against the Swiss franc,\par the dollar was trading at CHF1.6225, little changed from CHF1.6230 in\par New York overnight.\par   -By Miyako Takebe, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929;\par miyako.takebe@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The chart of late Tokyo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates which accompanied Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has\par been replaced with an enhanced \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fixture which is updated\par hourly.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Subscribers can find this table:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011010dxaa000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
