\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Japan forex \highlight\uc2  reserves hit record on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mariko Hayashibara \par \uc2 471 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Oktober 2001\par 06:07\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Oct 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's external reserves rose by $24.798 billion to a record $397.02 billion in September, boosted mainly by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as authorities fretted that an overvalued yen was hurting exports. \par \par \uc2  It was the biggest monthly rise in reserves on record, not counting technical adjustments. \par \par \uc2  "Among several reasons behind the rise ... \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the major factor," a Finance Ministry official told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the figure was in line with expectations and fitted in with market estimates that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent about $19.4 billion on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  up to late September. \par \par \uc2  In recent months, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves - the largest in the world - have been rising by about $4-5 billion a month. \par \par \uc2  Neither the reserves data nor the BOJ data on which bankers estimated the amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  included \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted on September 27 and 28, as \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  settlements take place two business days after transactions are carried out. \par \par \uc2  However, analysts have estimated that the BOJ spent a total of about $4 billion buying dollars against the yen on September 27 and 28. \par \par \uc2  That would put total \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the month of September at more than $23 billion - in monthly terms, one of the biggest \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  ever. \par \par \uc2  OVERVALUED YEN \par \par \uc2  The BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on seven days from September 17, mostly selling yen and buying dollars in an effort to weaken the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On at least three occasions it drafted in the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy euros for yen, and once used the New York Federal Reserve, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  was totally funded by Japan. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ acts as agent for the Finance Ministry and conducts market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  through brokers and commercial banks. \par \par \uc2  The BOJ stepped into the market shortly before the dollar fell to a seven-month low of around 115.87 yen in the aftermath of the attacks on New York and Washington on September 11. \par \par \uc2  It was the first time the BOJ had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on dollar/yen since April 2000. \par \par \uc2  The dollar stood at around 120.50 as of 0350 GMT on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "Considering other factors of reserve increase such as income gains on securities and revaluation as a result of movements of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels, the (reserves) figure turned out to be in line with our estimation," said Toru Umemoto, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Morgan Stanley Japan. \par \par \uc2  Apart from \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the reserves include securities such as bonds and gold, and take into account Japan's reserve position with the International Monetary Fund. \par \par \uc2  The overall figure changes from month to month based on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels, valuations and interest rates, as well as \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The exact amount of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  undertaken in September will appear in a quarterly report by the ministry due in November. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011005dxa5005ka\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
