\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ Sold 2 Trillion Yen In  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Mkt Through Sep 26th -Data \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 2001\par 13:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sold over Y2 trillion in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this month through Sep. 26, data released by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday showed. \par \par \uc2  In a monthly report entitled "Sources of Changes in Current Account Balance" the BOJ's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund showed a surplus of Y2.266 trillion ($19 billion) for this month on a settlement basis, mostly in line with market expectations. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  has ordered eight rounds of yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  this month. \par \par \uc2  However, only five \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  were encompassed in the report given the most recent three rounds of orchestrated BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  action have come since Wednesday - the last day in which trades can be settled this month. \par \par \uc2  The MOF has ordered repeated yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since Sep. 17 to stabilize the dollar in the aftermath of the Sep. 11 terrorist attacks in the U.S. \par \par \uc2  The dollar has appreciated about 5% against the yen since the BOJ first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . At 11:41 GMT the dollar was trading at Y119.48. \par \par \uc2  In August the BOJ's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  fund ran a deficit of Y8.0 billion, the data showed. On a year-to-date basis, the fund has a surplus of Y143.6 billion. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   -Tokyo Bureau, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010928dx9s000rp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
